"Totals and charts in your file refresh when it is opened in Excel. Some "
"other spreadsheet programs need “Recalculate” pressed."
msgstr ""
"Total dan grafik di berkas Anda diperbarui saat dibuka di Excel. Beberapa "
"program lembar kerja lain perlu menekan “Hitung ulang”."

