"Your Excel table “%s” starts here. It will grow and shrink with the rows."
msgstr ""
"Tabel Excel “%s” Anda dimulai di sini. Tabel akan memanjang dan memendek "
"mengikuti barisnya."

#. module: pb_excel_layout
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_excel_layout/static/src/xml/excel_layout.xml:0
